### 가맹점 생성 (merchant + cancel_limit 동시 생성)
POST http://localhost:8082/v1/merchants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantKey": "merchant_001",
  "name": "테스트 가맹점",
  "cancelPeriodDays": 30,
  "dailyLimit": 10000000
}

### 취소 한도 조회 (internal)
GET http://localhost:8082/internal/merchants/1001/cancel-limit

### 취소 한도 수정 (admin)
PUT http://localhost:8082/admin/merchants/1001/cancel-limit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dailyLimit": 20000000,
  "reason": "한도 증액 요청"
}

### 가맹점 상태 변경 (admin)
PATCH http://localhost:8082/admin/merchants/1001/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}
